WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
FROM CALIFORNIA TO NEW YORK ISLAND

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
FROM THE GRANDFORD NORRIST TO THE GOLD STREET WATERS

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
TO STAND CLOSING YOU AND ME.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
WHILE GRANTIFA SERENADES US WITH SONG,

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
NEW YORK TIMES COLUMNISTS ARE IN PORTLAND PLAYING PEAK-A-BOO.

